    <description><![CDATA[
# Haruna

Haruna is an open source media player built with Qt/QML and [libmpv](https://mpv.io/).

![Screenshot](https://cdn.statically.io/gh/Aurocosh/chocolatey-packages/master/automatic/haruna/img/screenshot.png)

## Features

- Auto playlist populated from the same folder as the opened file
- Video preview when hovering the seek bar
- Configurable keyboard shortcuts and mouse actions
- Play online videos through youtube-dl/yt-dlp
- Auto skip chapters containing certain words
- Custom mpv commands (at startup or via shortcuts)
- Theming via color schemes and widget styles
]]></description>
